residence within an existing property while ensuring the new dwelling complemented the main home and maximised the available land. Careful planning was required to optimise privacy, natural light, outdoor living and functionality, all while complying with planning and building regulations.","1a775156cdd0",[266],[],{"_151":166,"_153":167,"_168":267,"_170":268},[],"The Challenge","51125c4b4127",[272],[],{"_151":166,"_153":167,"_168":273,"_170":274},[],"This project demonstrates Siari Build’s ability to deliver practical, high-quality homes that make the most of every square metre while maintaining the same level of craftsmanship found in our larger custom homes.","d93c0484ec62",[278],[],{"_151":166,"_153":167,"_168":279,"_170":280},[],"The Reservoir Granny Flat is a contemporary custom-built secondary residence designed to maximise functionality, comfort and long-term value on an established suburban allotment. Despite its compact footprint, the home offers spacious open-plan living, premium finishes and modern architectural styling, making it ideal for extended family accommodation, guest living or investment purposes.","8686f08fba8d",[285],[],"h2",{"_151":286,"_153":167,"_168":287,"_170":288},"bba31a6db041",[],"Overview",{"_290":291,"_292":293},"settings",{"_330":331,"_332":333,"_334":335,"_336":337,"_338":101,"_339":340,"_341":-5,"_342":343,"_344":297,"_345":-5,"_346":-5,"_347":297,"_348":349,"_350":351,"_352":353,"_354":355,"_356":-5,"_357":358,"_359":360,"_120":361,"_362":363,"_364":365},"navigation",{"_294":295,"_296":297,"_298":299,"_300":301},"footerMenu",[323,324,325,326,327],"headerCtaEnabled",true,"headerMenu",[308,309,310,311],"socialMenu",[302],{"_303":-5,"_304":305,"_306":307},"icon","label","Instagram","url","https://www.instagram.com/siari_build/",{"_304":-5,"_313":321,"_315":322},{"_304":-5,"_313":319,"_315":320},{"_304":-5,"_313":317,"_315":318},{"_304":312,"_313":314,"_315":316},"Start Your Project","pageSlug","contact","pageTitle","Contact","projects","Projects","about","About","home","Home",{"_304":-5,"_313":321,"_315":322},{"_304":-5,"_313":319,"_315":320},{"_304":-5,"_313":317,"_315":318},{"_304":-5,"_313":314,"_315":316},{"_304":-5,"_313":328,"_315":329},"privacy-policy","Privacy Policy","address","Point Cook, Victoria","copyrightText","All rights reserved.","email","info@siaribuild.com.au","legalLine","ABN 20 688 039 894 | Builder License CDB-U 101713","maintenanceEnabled","maintenanceHeading","WE'RE ON THE TOOLS.","maintenanceImage","maintenanceMessage","The site's getting a quick upgrade and will be back shortly. In the meantime, if you'd like to start a project, reach us using the options below.","maintenanceShowContact","mapAddressLabel","mapAreaRadius","mapHidePin","mapLocation",{"_153":366,"_367":368,"_369":370,"_371":372},"mapZoom",12,"notFoundButtonLabel","Back to Home","notFoundHeading","THIS ONE'S OFF THE PLANS.","notFoundImage","notFoundMessage","The page you're after isn't here — moved, renamed, or never built. Let's get you back to solid ground.","phone","0419 000 991","Siari Build","tagline","We don't just build houses. We build the next forty years of your life.","workingHours","Monday - Friday: 8:00 AM - 5:00 PM\nSaturday: 9:00 AM - 2:00 PM\nSunday: Closed","geopoint","alt",7,"lat",-37.895696,"lng",144.76186]
